#: includes/class-mode-manager.php:382
msgid "Advanced Security Keys"
msgstr "Erweiterte Sicherheitsschlüssel"

#: includes/class-mode-manager.php:382
msgid "Multiple security keys per account (primary + backup), automatic model detection via attestation and key-lifecycle email alerts. One security key or passkey per account stays free."
